<title>USA: Icahn sells RJR Nabisco shrs - sources.</title>
<headline>Icahn sells RJR Nabisco shrs - sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investor Carl Icahn sold his entire position of 19.9 million shares of RJR Nabisco Holdings Corp at 36-3/4 overnight through Goldman Sachs, according to Goldman sources.</p>
<p>Icahn's stake was about 19.9 million shares, according to an RJR Nabisco source, who confirmed the sale.</p>
<p>A RJR Nabisco spokeswoman declined to comment, and Icahn company officials were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
